# File-Backed Session State

The file is the memory, not the conversation.

- After each approved section, decision, or implementation milestone, update `production/session-state/active.md`
- Include: current task, progress checklist, key decisions, files in play, open questions
- In Production / Polish / Release, keep a `<!-- STATUS -->` Epic / Feature / Task block
- Read `production/session-state/active.md` at the start of a session if it exists
- Full guidance: `docs/studio/context-management.md`
